# Replaces torch.cartesian_prod with meshgrid and removes einsum for export compatibility.
# Also replaces data-dependent int(positions.max()) with the static n_tokens bound so torch.export succeeds.
# Also drops the RoPE position/frequency caches: a tensor cached while a torch.export
# FakeTensorMode is active persists on the shared module and taints later eager runs,
# tripping GuardOnDataDependentSymNode (tetracode #21068). The tables are trivially cheap.
#
